# GEO-099:重宣告會把 index 0 從 1000 移到 1500,而角材 3 錨在那條線上
# → I23(a) 拒絕(V_GRID_LOCKED),World 留在舊狀態。
surface 1 origin 0 0 2500 u +x v +y outline 0,0 4000,0 4000,3000 0,3000
grid 1 on 1 u 1000
timber 1 20 20 role boundary
timber 2 20 20 role boundary
timber 3 27 33 role primary
place 1 on 1 at-face e0 +u +n
place 2 on 1 at-face e2 -u +n
place 3 on 1 at-line grid 1 u 0 +v +n
grid 1 on 1 u 1500
